/*
  RateLimitStatusPanel.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0038 · RateLimitStatusPanel (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `RateLimitStatusPanel` resolves (table "RateLimitStatusPanel") lives here with its
  web `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (features/admin/components/RateLimitStatusPanel.tsx — title, subtitle, the
  RateLimitRow labels, the severity sub-keys, and the loading / error / empty
  branches). The second group backs the native-only chrome (stale / offline chips,
  the retry affordance, accessibility) the Apple HIG states contract requires.
*/

